### Simple box

```dart
Container(
  child: Text("Hello"),
)
```

### Sized box

```dart
Container(
  width: 200,
  height: 100,
)
```

### Background

```dart
Container(
  color: Colors.blue,
)
```

### Padding

```dart
Container(
  padding: EdgeInsets.all(20),
)
```

### Margin

```dart
Container(
  margin: EdgeInsets.all(20),
)
```

### Rounded box

```dart
Container(
  decoration: BoxDecoration(
    borderRadius: BorderRadius.circular(20),
  ),
)
```

### Border

```dart
Container(
  decoration: BoxDecoration(
    border: Border.all(),
  ),
)
```

---

# 26. One-Line Definition

**`Container` is a versatile Flutter widget used to control the size, spacing, alignment, background, border, and decoration of a single child widget.**
